{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udee7</strong> <strong>A <i>Whimsical</i> Bubble-Popping Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into this\u00a0<strong>incremental clicker/idle hybrid</strong> with <strong>tower defense elements</strong>! Start as a lone bubble-popper, build a formidable cat army, and discover strategic synergies that\u2019ll make your inner cat enthusiast purr with delight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/newgif0-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1743780969\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Gameplay <i>101</i> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>Pop bubbles</u></i></strong><i><u> \u2192 <strong>hire cats</strong> \u2192 <strong>dominate the bubble realm</strong>!</u></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f Click:</strong> Build <i>satisfying combos</i> and earn\u00a0<i>cash</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc08\u00a0<strong>Recruit</strong>: Assemble a quirky workforce from\u00a0<i>lazy paw-swipers</i> to <i>explosive Devilcats.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Invest</strong>: Unlock <i>upgrades</i>, <i>powers</i>, <i>new cats</i>, and discover new synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explore</strong>: Discover <i>mysterious shrines</i> housing\u00a0<i>extraordinarily rare </i>cats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04\u00a0<strong>Ascend</strong>: <i>Prestige</i> with purpose, gaining <u>permanent</u> upgrades and unique abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/newgif1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1743780969\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Meet <i>Byte</i>, The Inspiration! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game's muse spends his days conducting\u00a0<i>gravity experiments </i>(knocking stuff off counters) or <i>battling his arch-nemesis</i> (the mirror). His fascination with soap bubbles was too adorable to not immortalize in game form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/byteswipe.gif?t=1743780969\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong>\ud83e\udd14\u00a0<strong>Choose\u00a0<i>Your</i> Playstyle</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\uddd8 Zen Master</strong>: Relax as your cat army handles everything <i>(while silently judging you).</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc79\u00a0<strong>Clicker Demon</strong>: Chase <i>x25 combos</i> until your mouse <i>begs</i> for mercy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/newgif2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1743780969\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Features That <i>Pop</i> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc31\u00a0<strong>Cats</strong>: <i>Unicats</i>, <i>Devilcats</i>, and more \u2014 each with <u>unique</u> abilities and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf\u00a0<strong>Play Your Way</strong>: <i>Tower defense brainiac</i> or <i>zen bubble ASMR enthusiast</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80\u00a0<strong>Prestige with Purpose</strong>: Unlock <i><u>game-breaking</u> perks</i>, not just boring +1% bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf10\u00a0<strong>Endless Scale</strong>: Expand your map to host <i>thousands</i> of bubbles and cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Replay for Glory</strong>: Try\u00a0<i>speedrunning </i>milestones\u00a0after your first playthrough!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Completionist Heaven</strong>: Over ~400 achievements\u00a0to <i>hunt</i>\u00a0and <i>showcase</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/newgif3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1743780969\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc96 Crafted With <i>Players</i> In Mind</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0b\u00a0<strong>Zero Cash Grabs</strong>: Everything\u2019s included! No ads, no &quot;gem&quot; BS \u2014 just cats being weird.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf5e\u00a0<strong>Toasters Welcome</strong>: Runs smoothly even on your laptop from 2001.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbb\u00a0<strong>Open-Source Code</strong>: Rip it apart, make a <i>Dog Mode</i>, whatever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udeae\u00a0<strong>Authentic Cat Hair</strong>: Byte contributed to development by shedding on my keyboard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/newgif4-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1743780969\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Declare <i>War</i> on Bubbles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Click, strategize, explore, and ascend \u2014 the bubble realm awaits your feline army!</strong></i></u></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Initiation Pop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499760/b89c1197871b4d63cfbd8838ee06bbda5b5aa001.jpg"},{"name":"Finger Fitness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499760/8f4b0225197a47b9ad490f496f05f0be036f6716.jpg"},{"name":