 tower defense with satisfying click-combos and quirky cats who automate your bubble-popping empire. \ud83d\udc31 Click, strategize, conquer! \ud83d\udc51","steam_appid":3499760,"support_info":{"email":"mail@vittorioromeo.com","url":"https://vittorioromeo.com"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}